# What the editor's image is built from: the compiler's crates, the
# standard library, the editor, the examples. Everything else stays out —
# the build output above all, which is gigabytes.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates
!lib
!editors/web
!examples
!tools/dist.sh
!LANGUAGE.md
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
crates/**/target
